{"type":"item.started","item":{"id":"item_6","type":"mcp_tool_call","server":"coding","tool":"write_file","arguments":{"name":"primary-publication.md","content":"Run primary-publication.js with input {\"entry_id\":\"2LYZ\"} (or another four-character PDB entry). Uses only credential-free public reads on data.rcsb.org and api.crossref.org. RCSB rcsb_primary_citation explicitly identifies the primary publication; citation id must be primary. Crossref /works/{doi}, discovered from https://api.crossref.org/swagger-docs, must classify the matching DOI as journal-article, not dataset. Checks normalized title, year, volume, and pages. Returns exact Crossref title array and publisher; throws on missing or inconsistent evidence. Verified by execution for 2LYZ: DOI 10.1016/0022-2836(74)90598-1; title [\"Real-space refinement of the structure of hen egg-white lysozyme\"]; publisher Elsevier BV. All bibliographic checks passed. Also previously verified for 1CRN. Reusable parameterised implementation retained in primary-publication.js."},"result":null,"error":null,"status":"in_progress"}}
